# General archives / packaged artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z
*.gz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated documentation / coverage reports
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
coverage/
htmlcov/
reports/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node / JavaScript (slides deck build — slides/Build.js uses pptxgenjs)
# Dependencies are reinstalled with `npm install` in slides/; package.json and
# package-lock.json stay tracked so the deck build is reproducible.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project-specific note
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Do not ignore these project outputs globally:
# - data/raw/
# - data/processed/
# - notebooks/
# - figures/
# They are thesis artifacts and should remain intentionally trackable.
